## 5. Macro-Historical Cycle Synthesis (Bibliography)

Within the **Convergence** macro-historical framework, this academic bibliography serves as the primary literature foundation. It bridges the technical mechanics of the Law of Accelerating Returns (Kurzweil, 2005) with the economic long-wave dynamics of the **6th Kondratiev Wave** (Perez, 2002), the social crisis dynamics of the **Fourth Turning** (Strauss & Howe, 1997), and the geopolitical transitions of global hegemony (Dalio, 2021), proving that Technological Singularity research is an essential component of 21st-century civilizational analysis.


